{"toolCallId":"call_0907d44a48c941df911602ff97b2756d","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"---\ntitle: \"Feature Specification: Fix the review findings on the series parent rule\"\ndescription: \"The phase 7 review found the series parent recipe unrunnable, stale copies of the rule in four docs, an unsanitized listing and unfinished phase 6 records. This phase fixes all twelve findings and two close-out gaps.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"series parent review fixes\"\n  - \"phase 8 series parent review fixes\"\n  - \"runnable series parent recipe\"\nimportance_tier: \"normal\"\ncontextType: \"implementation\"\n---\n<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: spec-core | v2.2 -->\n# Feature Specification: Fix the review findings on the series parent rule\n\n<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 2 -->\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:metadata -->\n## 1. METADATA\n\n| Field | Value |\n===\nspecs/system-speckit/034-spec-folder-tooling/008-series-parent-review-fixes/acceptance-criteria.md:91\nspecs/system-speckit/034-spec-folder-tooling/008-series-parent-review-fixes/implementation-summary.md:120\nspecs/system-speckit/034-spec-folder-tooling/008-series-parent-review-fixes/plan.md:192\nspecs/system-speckit/034-spec-folder-tooling/008-series-parent-review-fixes/spec.md:205\nspecs/system-speckit/034-spec-folder-tooling/008-series-parent-review-fixes/tasks.md:190\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w904a7ae601/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"3914f5","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
