{"toolCallId":"call_d552e9940a464134a197126dc5102c44","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"<!-- IF level:1,2,3,3+ -->\n---\n<!-- IF level:1 -->\ntitle: \"Tasks: [NAME] [template:level-1/tasks.md]\"\n<!-- /IF -->\n<!-- IF level:2 -->\ntitle: \"Tasks: [NAME] [template:level-2/tasks.md]\"\n<!-- /IF -->\n<!-- IF level:3 -->\ntitle: \"Tasks: [NAME] [template:level-3/tasks.md]\"\n<!-- /IF -->\n<!-- IF level:3+ -->\ntitle: \"Tasks: [NAME] [template:level_3+/tasks.md]\"\n<!-- /IF -->\ndescription: \"Task Format: T### [P?] Description (file path)\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"task breakdown\"\n  - \"implementation tasks\"\n  - \"verification checklist\"\n  - \"task dependencies\"\nimportance_tier: \"normal\"\ncontextType: \"general\"\n---\n# Tasks: [NAME]\n\n<!-- IF level:1 -->\n<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 1 -->\n<!-- /IF -->\n<!-- IF level:2 -->\n<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 2 -->\n<!-- /IF -->\n<!-- IF level:3 -->\n<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 3 -->\n<!-- /IF -->\n<!-- IF level:3+ -->\n<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 3+ -->\n<!-- /IF -->\n<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: tasks-core | v2.2 -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:notation -->\n## Task Notation\n\n| Prefix | Meaning |\n|--------|---------|\n| `[ ]` | Pending |\n| `[x]` | Completed |\n| `[P]` | Parallelizable |\n| `[B]` | Blocked |\n\n**Task Format**: `T### [P?] Description (file path)`\n<!-- /ANCHOR:notation -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:phase-1 -->\n## Phase 1: Setup\n\n- [ ] T001 Create project structure\n- [ ] T002 Install dependencies\n- [ ] T003 [P] Configure development tools\n<!-- /ANCHOR:phase-1 -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:phase-2 -->\n## Phase 2: Implementation\n\n- [ ] T004 [Implement core feature 1]\n- [ ] T005 [Implement core feature 2]\n- [ ] T006 [Implement core feature 3]\n- [ ] T007 [Add error handling]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:phase-2 -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:phase-3 -->\n## Phase 3: Verification\n\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w904a7ae601/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"a49b3a","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
